flowchart LR
  U[Authenticated user] --> C[User-owned endpoint configuration]
  C --> P[Owned destination and redirect policy]
  A[Administrator allowlist and credential bindings] --> P
  P --> B[Policy-built HTTP clients]
  B --> N[Approved network destinations]
  K[Destination-scoped credential] --> B
  O[OIDC provider] --> F[Next.js auth]
  CA[Scoped CA or public PKI] --> F
